---
kind: quest
luteVersion: "0.16.0"
uses: ../world.schema.yaml
title: Who Wakes
---

/*
  The exchange rate. Vesna states it in the first line of the cryobank — "Every
  pod you crack, the Purser reads as load" — so the quest becomes available the
  moment the cold wake ends and you are walking toward the bank.

  `after=` is a `<quest>` ATTRIBUTE, not a frontmatter key (see T9.1); this is
  the earliest node in the route graph from which the question can be asked.
*/
<quest id="whoWakes" title="Who Wakes" start="true" after="visited('anseo.s01ep01')">
<objective id="bringSomebodyUp" title="Bring somebody up out of the bank" done="count(awake(_)) >= 2"/>
<objective id="knowTheExchange" title="Learn what a body costs the schedule" done="run.shedPressure >= 1" when="quest.whoWakes.objectives.bringSomebodyUp.done"/>
<objective id="theFifthBody" title="Find the one the ship never counted" done="holds(found(ottavio))" optional/>
<on event="questComplete">
@narrator: Two of you up, and a schedule that had already read the bill.
</on>
</quest>
